From: Orange Pi Googlebook port
Subject: [PATCH] cgroup: permit CAP_SYS_NICE task migration as in Android common

Match android16-6.12 cgroup-v1 migration authorization. Android system_server
runs as UID 1000 with CAP_SYS_NICE and moves application tasks across UIDs.
Retain the existing owner checks, file permissions, and SELinux enforcement.

Reference: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android16-6.12/kernel/cgroup/cgroup-v1.c

--- a/kernel/cgroup/cgroup-v1.c
+++ b/kernel/cgroup/cgroup-v1.c
@@ -523,7 +523,8 @@
 	tcred = get_task_cred(task);
 	if (!uid_eq(cred->euid, GLOBAL_ROOT_UID) &&
 	    !uid_eq(cred->euid, tcred->uid) &&
-	    !uid_eq(cred->euid, tcred->suid))
+	    !uid_eq(cred->euid, tcred->suid) &&
+	    !ns_capable(tcred->user_ns, CAP_SYS_NICE))
 		ret = -EACCES;
 	put_cred(tcred);
 	if (ret)
